Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `Lease` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/ownership/single_use_copy_is_refused.jet:11:41
    |
 11 | copy_value: fn(lease: Lease) -> Lease { lease.copy() }
    |                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Lease` is `#SingleUse`: it carries one duty that has to be done exactly once, and a copy would let that duty be done twice
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211

Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `Holder` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/ownership/single_use_copy_is_refused.jet:13:45
    |
 13 | copy_holder: fn(holder: Holder) -> Holder { holder.copy() }
    |                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: It holds a `#SingleUse` value, which carries one duty that has to be done exactly once, and a copy would let that duty be done twice
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211
